ttps://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75286674_1588393147985032_8464614538505281207_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-TUKzcksPXkQ7kNvwGKaH0y&_nc_oc=AdrLc1uoDmaLwXASvMMNnbyThoBh7FPCrcfeAJVSYbxMyZ0VzXD0V1mYuasKpUgtdRA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTBUY21L5y4gIeASyXQNvPpQshhmpbp8nKQgdoXXOIq4w&oe=6AFB1F36"}, "display_name": "Hoppy Animals", "keywords": ["Hoppy", "Animals", "Hopping", "Animal"], "long_description": "\"It's a very interesting game. There is not a lot of these in VR.\" - GoBros\n\nHoppy Animals is a third-person action-adventure 3D platformer game.\n\nSet in an imaginative, cartoonish candy world and nightmare world, a dog, a cat and a mouse will test their abilities against various obstacles, including scimitar-wielding, firearm-slinging undead pirates!\n\n- Designed specifically for Gear VR and Oculus Go\n- Over 40 levels of gameplay\n- Family-friendly\n- Visually beautiful\n- Adorable orchestral soundtrack\n- Multi-cast voice acting\n- Almost like participating in an animated movie\n- Comfortable gameplay (VR dizziness minimized, standing or swivel chair not required)\n- Supports Oculus Go and Gear VR controllers\n- Supports bluetooth gamepad\n\nImmerse in a beautiful fairy tale of talking animals, pirates and candies. You will visit a candy town, ride in a giant butterfly ship, and brave a cartoonish haunted house. This game is sheer eye candy, literally, and it just makes you feel good!", "short_description": "Control a dog, a cat and a mouse in this action-adventure 3D platformer game. Immerse in a beautiful fairy tale of talking animals, pirates and candies."}]}, "developer_name": "Truthveyor Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://truthveyor.weebly.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.truthveyor.com/privacy-policy-terms-of-service.html", "publisher_name": "Tony Chen Productions", "support_website_url": null, "webs